## 🎯 Quick Wins (Low Effort, High Delight)

If you want to ship 3 things this week that users will notice immediately:

1. **PWA install banner** — turns your web app into a phone-installable one in ~1 hour.
2. **WhatsApp share receipt** — one-click send receipt to customer's phone. Ghanaians love WhatsApp.
3. **Keyboard shortcuts on POS** (F2 search, F9 charge, Esc clear) — already started in my previous rewrite; just document them in a help modal.
4. **Dark mode** — free with Tailwind, cashiers love it at night.
5. **Barcode scanner support** — most USB/Bluetooth scanners act as keyboards; just make sure POS search field is always focused.

